# SPA fallback is handled by the Workers static-assets runtime via
# `not_found_handling = "single-page-application"` in wrangler.toml — every mode is its own
# URL (/silhouette, /zoom, …) but the app is a single-page bundle, so unmatched paths serve
# index.html and the client router picks the mode from the URL. A `/* /index.html 200` rule
# here is rejected by the deploy validator as an infinite loop (code 100324), so don't add it.
